Comment: The app speaks the MeshCore companion protocol. Protocol and firmware: MeshCore,
 Copyright (c) Scott Powell / rippleradios.com, MIT, https://github.com/meshcore-dev/MeshCore.
 The protocol code was written from the protocol documentation and from meshcore_py (Copyright (c) Florent de Lamotte,
 MIT, https://github.com/meshcore-dev/meshcore_py), which was used as the reference of the wire format.
 The UX is inspired by MeshCore clients such as wadamesh (GPL-3.0), Meshy (GPL-3.0-or-later), meshcore-gui (MIT) and
 MeshCore Open (MIT): ideas only, no code was copied from the GPL ones.

